{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-er-diagram",
  "category": "diagrams",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-er-diagram&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-er-diagram",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Diagrama entidad-relación en SVG, sin Mermaid. Declaras entidades con sus",
        "          atributos y las relaciones entre ellas; el componente ubica las cajas,",
        "          rutea las líneas con A* y dibuja la notación de pata de gallo en cada extremo."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          Comparte motor con <code>&lt;iswc-flowchart&gt;</code>: mismo esquema JSON de",
            "          grupos/leyenda, mismo visor a pantalla completa y la misma animación tortuga.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-er-diagram open-on-click>",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"erDiagram\": {",
            "                  \"title\": \"Facturación electrónica\",",
            "                  \"direction\": \"LR\",",
            "                  \"groups\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g1\", \"name\": \"Facturación\", \"hue\": 199 },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g2\", \"name\": \"Terceros\", \"hue\": 239 }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"entities\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"FACTURA\", \"name\": \"FACTURA\", \"group\": \"g1\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [",
            "                        { \"name\": \"id\", \"type\": \"int\", \"key\": \"PK\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"cliente_id\", \"type\": \"int\", \"key\": \"FK\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"fecha\", \"type\": \"date\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"total\", \"type\": \"decimal\" }",
            "                      ] },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"ITEM\", \"name\": \"ITEM_FACTURA\", \"group\": \"g1\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [",
            "                        { \"name\": \"id\", \"type\": \"int\", \"key\": \"PK\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"factura_id\", \"type\": \"int\", \"key\": \"FK\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"producto_id\", \"type\": \"int\", \"key\": \"FK\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"cantidad\", \"type\": \"decimal\" }",
            "                      ] },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"CLIENTE\", \"name\": \"CLIENTE\", \"group\": \"g2\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [",
            "                        { \"name\": \"id\", \"type\": \"int\", \"key\": \"PK\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"nombre\", \"type\": \"varchar\" }",
            "                      ] },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"PRODUCTO\", \"name\": \"PRODUCTO\", \"group\": \"g2\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [",
            "                        { \"name\": \"id\", \"type\": \"int\", \"key\": \"PK\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"nombre\", \"type\": \"varchar\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"precio\", \"type\": \"decimal\" }",
            "                      ] }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"relations\": [",
            "                    { \"from\": \"FACTURA\", \"to\": \"CLIENTE\", \"label\": \"pertenece a\", \"fromCard\": \"many\", \"toCard\": \"one\", \"identifying\": true },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"FACTURA\", \"to\": \"ITEM\", \"label\": \"contiene\", \"fromCard\": \"one\", \"toCard\": \"many\", \"identifying\": true },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"ITEM\", \"to\": \"PRODUCTO\", \"label\": \"referencia\", \"fromCard\": \"zeroOrOne\", \"toCard\": \"zeroOrMany\", \"identifying\": false }",
            "                  ]",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-er-diagram>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:open-on-click",
              "label": "open-on-click"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cardinalidad",
      "title": "Cardinalidad",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          Cada extremo de una relación admite <code>one</code>, <code>many</code>,",
            "          <code>zeroOrOne</code> y <code>zeroOrMany</code>, dibujados como pata de",
            "          gallo / marca de uno / círculo de opcionalidad, igual que la notación",
            "          crow's foot clásica. <code>identifying: false</code> dibuja la línea punteada.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-er-diagram open-on-click>",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"erDiagram\": {",
            "                  \"direction\": \"LR\",",
            "                  \"entities\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"A\", \"name\": \"A\", \"attributes\": [{ \"name\": \"id\", \"type\": \"int\", \"key\": \"PK\" }] },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"B\", \"name\": \"B\", \"attributes\": [{ \"name\": \"id\", \"type\": \"int\", \"key\": \"PK\" }] }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"relations\": [",
            "                    { \"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"B\", \"label\": \"1 a N\", \"fromCard\": \"one\", \"toCard\": \"many\" }",
            "                  ]",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-er-diagram>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "theme-insoft",
      "title": "Tema InSoft",
      "lede": "Sin CE nuevo: theme=\"insoft\" (o erDiagram.theme) aplica el estilo docs InSoft (Poppins, naranja/verde, clusters, aristas #3D5A80). El JSON vive en cdn/diagrams/themes/insoft.json; json2css lo convierte a CSS.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p>Misma paleta que <code>der.svg</code> de AyudasCPIA. El editor hereda el atributo: <code>&lt;iswc-er-editor theme=\"insoft\"&gt;</code>. Utils CDN: <code>L.loadPageModules(\"iswc-diagram-theme\")</code> → <code>json2css</code>, <code>resolveErTheme</code>, <code>INSOFT_THEME</code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-er-diagram theme=\"insoft\" open-on-click>",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"erDiagram\": {",
            "                  \"title\": \"ISS · estilo InSoft\",",
            "                  \"direction\": \"LR\",",
            "                  \"groups\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g_oper\", \"name\": \"Operativa\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g_conf\", \"name\": \"Config\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g_seg\", \"name\": \"SEG\" }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"entities\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"ticket\", \"name\": \"TICKET\", \"group\": \"g_oper\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [",
            "                        { \"name\": \"id\", \"type\": \"uuid\", \"key\": \"PK\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"asunto\", \"type\": \"varchar\" }",
            "                      ] },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"conv\", \"name\": \"CONVERSATION\", \"group\": \"g_oper\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [",
            "                        { \"name\": \"id\", \"type\": \"uuid\", \"key\": \"PK\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"ticket_id\", \"type\": \"uuid\", \"key\": \"FK\" }",
            "                      ] },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"sys\", \"name\": \"SYS_VALUES\", \"group\": \"g_conf\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [",
            "                        { \"name\": \"clave\", \"type\": \"varchar\", \"key\": \"PK\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"valor\", \"type\": \"jsonb\" }",
            "                      ] },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"rol\", \"name\": \"SEG_ROL\", \"group\": \"g_seg\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [",
            "                        { \"name\": \"id\", \"type\": \"int\", \"key\": \"PK\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"nombre\", \"type\": \"varchar\" }",
            "                      ] },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"huérfana\", \"name\": \"PROVIDER\", \"group\": \"g_conf\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [",
            "                        { \"name\": \"id\", \"type\": \"uuid\", \"key\": \"PK\" },",
            "                        { \"name\": \"nombre\", \"type\": \"varchar\" }",
            "                      ] }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"relations\": [",
            "                    { \"from\": \"conv\", \"to\": \"ticket\", \"fromCard\": \"many\", \"toCard\": \"one\", \"identifying\": true },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"ticket\", \"to\": \"rol\", \"fromCard\": \"many\", \"toCard\": \"one\", \"identifying\": false }",
            "                  ]",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-er-diagram>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "title": "Referencia",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Atributos</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Nombre",
            "Valores",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>variant</code>",
              "<code>inline</code> · <code>viewer</code>",
              "inline abre el visor al hacer clic; viewer activa hover, tooltips, leyenda clickeable y auto-animación."
            ],
            [
              "<code>open-on-click</code>",
              "booleano",
              "Habilita abrir el visor a pantalla completa al hacer clic. Por defecto el componente no tiene visor."
            ],
            [
              "<code>theme</code>",
              "<code>insoft</code> · id registrado",
              "Aplica paleta JSON (cdn/diagrams/themes/). También <code>erDiagram.theme</code> en el payload."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Esquema del JSON</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Campo",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>direction</code>",
              "<code>TB</code> · <code>BT</code> · <code>LR</code> (default) · <code>RL</code>."
            ],
            [
              "<code>entities[].id</code>",
              "Identificador que referencian las relaciones."
            ],
            [
              "<code>entities[].attributes[].key</code>",
              "<code>PK</code> · <code>FK</code>; se pinta como badge junto al nombre."
            ],
            [
              "<code>entities[].group</code>",
              "Id del grupo; tiñe el encabezado de la caja."
            ],
            [
              "<code>relations[].fromCard</code> · <code>toCard</code>",
              "<code>one</code> · <code>many</code> · <code>zeroOrOne</code> · <code>zeroOrMany</code>."
            ],
            [
              "<code>relations[].identifying</code>",
              "<code>true</code> (default, línea sólida) · <code>false</code> (línea punteada)."
            ],
            [
              "<code>groups[].hue</code>",
              "Tono HSL 0–360."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Propiedades y eventos</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Nombre",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>payload</code>",
              "Configuración JSON; alternativa al script hijo."
            ],
            [
              "<code>layout</code>",
              "Geometría calculada (solo lectura)."
            ],
            [
              "<code>turtle</code>",
              "API de la animación: play / pause / stop / next / prev."
            ],
            [
              "<code>hiddenGroups</code>",
              "Set de grupos ocultos; al cambiar, el diagrama se re-diseña sin esas entidades."
            ],
            [
              "<code>iswc-render</code>",
              "Evento: el SVG terminó de construirse."
            ],
            [
              "<code>iswc-turtle-state</code>",
              "Evento: estado de la animación."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "app-api",
      "title": "App API",
      "lede": "El mismo documento se abre en el visor o en el editor. El parámetro json no se reescribe al modificar el diagrama.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p><a href=\"demos/diagramas/app/view.html?kind=er\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Abrir visor</a> · <a href=\"demos/diagramas/app/edit.html?kind=er\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Abrir editor</a></p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
